{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49630","headline":"定风波 三 · 李珣","name":"定风波 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又见辞巢燕子归，阮郎何事绝音徽。\n帘外西风黄叶落，池阁，隐莎蛩叫雨霏霏。\n愁坐算程千万里，频跂，等闲经岁两相违。\n听鹊凭龟无定处，不知，泪痕流在画罗衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}